  "slug": "buying-a-pair-of-shoes",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2025_buying-a-pair-of-shoes.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Long ago, a man from the state of Zheng planned to buy a pair of shoes at the market. First, he measured his feet. Then he went to the market and found a shoe seller. Just as he was about to buy a pair, he suddenly remembered that he had left his measurements at home, so he hurried back to get them.",
    "After picking up his measurements, he ran back to the market, but it had already closed. When someone heard what had happened, they were puzzled and asked, “Why didn’t you try the shoes on?” The man replied, “I trust the measurements I took. I’m not so sure I can trust my feet.”",
    "The man trusted the measurements he had taken but not his own feet. In the end, he failed to buy any shoes and became a laughingstock. The lesson is to pay attention to the real situation and be willing to adapt."
  ],
  "english_full": "Long ago, a man from the state of Zheng planned to buy a pair of shoes at the market. First, he measured his feet. Then he went to the market and found a shoe seller. Just as he was about to buy a pair, he suddenly remembered that he had left his measurements at home, so he hurried back to get them.\n\nAfter picking up his measurements, he ran back to the market, but it had already closed. When someone heard what had happened, they were puzzled and asked, “Why didn’t you try the shoes on?” The man replied, “I trust the measurements I took. I’m not so sure I can trust my feet.”\n\nThe man trusted the measurements he had taken but not his own feet. In the end, he failed to buy any shoes and became a laughingstock. The lesson is to pay attention to the real situation and be willing to adapt.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Давнó, дя́дя из госуда́рства Чжэн плани́ровал купи́ть па́ру ту́флей на ры́нке. В пе́рвую о́чередь он измери́л свои́ но́ги. Тогда́ он по́шёл на ры́нок и нашёл продавца́ ту́флей. Как ра́з он собира́лся купи́ть па́ру, вдруг он вспо́мнил, что остави́л свои́ измере́ния до́ма, поэ́тому он по́спешил назад, чтобы взя́ть их.",
    "По́сле того́ как он взя́л свои́ измере́ния, он побе́жил назад на ры́нок, но он уже́ закрылся. Когда́ кто́-то услы́шал, что случи́лось, он был озада́чен и спра́шивал: «Почему́ ты не попы́тался приме́рить ту́фли?» Дя́дя ответи́л: «Я доверя́ю измере́ниям, которые я взял. Я не у́верен, что могу́ доверя́ть своим но́гам.»",
    "Дя́дя доверя́л измере́ниям, которые он взял, но не своим но́гам. В конце́ концо́в, он не смог купи́ть ни одних ту́флей и стал объектом насме́шек. Уро́к в том, что надо обрати́ть внима́ние на настоя́щую ситуа́цию и быть гото́вым адапти́роваться."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Davnó, dyádya iz gosudárstva Chzhén planíroval kupít' páru túfley na rýnke. V pérvuyu óchered' on izmeríl svoí nógi. Togdá on póshyol na rýnok i náshël prodavtsá túfley. Kak ráz on sobirálsya kupít' páru, vdrug on vspómnil, chto ostavíl svoí izmeríeniya dóma, poé tomu on póspeshil nazád, chtoby vzýat' ikh.",
    "Pósle tógo kak on vzýal svoí izmeríeniya, on pobezhíl nazád na rýnok, no on užé zakrýlsya. Kogdá któ-to uslýshal, chto sluchílos', on byl ozádachen i spráshival: «Pochemú ty ne popýtalsya primetít' túfli?» Dyádya otvetíl: «Ya doverýayu izmeríeniyam, kotorye ya vzýal. Ya ne úveren, chto mogú doverýat'sya svoim nógam.»",
    "Dyádya doverýal izmeríeniyam, kotorye on vzýal, no ne svoim nógam. V kantsé kóncov, on ne smóg kupít' ni odnýkh túfley i stal ob'ektom nasméshek. Urók v tom, chto nado obratít' vnimániye na nastoyáshchuyu sitúatsiyu i byt' gotóvym adaptírovát'sya."
  ],
